+\ An import table's offset in KOBJ and its length: names each ending in a NUL,
+\ so the last byte is one.
+: IMPORTS ( -- n n )
+   NEXT {: u:n :}
+   AT @ {: off:n :}
+   u SKIP
+   u 0 > if off u + 1 - 0 KOBJ swap + c@ 0<> if BAD then then
+   off u ;
+
 : SECTIONS ( -- )
    40 AT !
    NEXT {: codeu:n :}
@@ -140,6 +141,8 @@ variable PATH-U
