+: MACHO-IMPORTS$ ( -- ptr u8 n ) 0 KOBJ MACHO-AT @ +  MACHO-U @ ;
+: ELF-IMPORTS$ ( -- ptr u8 n ) 0 KOBJ ELF-AT @ +  ELF-U @ ;
+
 \ The header cells the object gives a value: preset k's value and offset.
